      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The data point states what it is, in the fields the\ncontroller reports its side in; a converter only\ndecodes and encodes:\n\n   DataType and DimensionCount on every data point\n   — a DIntDataPoint is a scalar DINT.\n\n   StringDataPoint adds the configured capacity,\n   an array data point its element count.",
